## Layer 2: Utility Functions and Unrolling

### Scope Contract
- `data/catalogue.ts` must export a pure function `unrollDescendantKeys(nodeId: string): string[]` that recursively gathers the input ID plus all descendant IDs from `slotMetadataMap`.
- `data/catalogue.ts` must export a pure function `buildGroqKeysParam(keys: string[]): string[]` that returns the keys as a GROQ-safe string array parameter.
- A shared transform utility must be created to eliminate duplicate JSON-to-CatalogueNavItem mapping.

### DoD

✔ [ ] 2.1 — In `data/catalogue.ts`: implement and export `unrollDescendantKeys(nodeId: string): string[]`. The function must: (a) Load `slotMetadataMap` from the manifest. (b) If `nodeId` is not found, return `[]`. (c) Return an array containing `nodeId` itself plus all descendant IDs found by recursively looking up `children` in `slotMetadataMap`. (d) Use a `Set` internally to prevent infinite loops if the data has cycles. @done(26-03-26 12:59)
  - Difficulty: 5 - A(data/catalogue.ts): implement VFS key unrolling pure function — closes DoD item 2.1 on VFS_REFACTOR

✔ [ ] 2.2 — In `data/catalogue.ts`: implement and export `buildGroqKeysParam(keys: string[]): string[]`. This function simply returns the input array. Its purpose is to act as a semantic boundary — the caller passes unrolled keys, the output is ready for GROQ `$params`. If the input is empty, return `[]`. @done(26-03-26 12:59)
  - Difficulty: 1 - A(data/catalogue.ts): implement GROQ param builder function — closes DoD item 2.2 on VFS_REFACTOR

✔ [ ] 2.3 — Create `app/components/layout/catalogue/catalogue-nav.utils.ts`. Export a function `transformCatalogueJson(rawData: { catalogue: any[] }): CatalogueNavItem[]` that contains the JSON-to-CatalogueNavItem mapping currently duplicated in `CatalogueNavbar.tsx` (lines 10-21) and `CatalogueCarousel.tsx` (lines 14-25). @done(26-03-26 12:59)
  - Difficulty: 2 - C(app/components/layout/catalogue/catalogue-nav.utils.ts): extract shared transform — closes DoD item 2.3 on VFS_REFACTOR

✔ [ ] 2.4 — Update `CatalogueNavbar.tsx` to import and use `transformCatalogueJson` from `catalogue-nav.utils.ts`. Remove the inline transformation code. @done(26-03-26 12:59)
  - Difficulty: 2 - C(app/components/layout/catalogue/CatalogueNavbar.tsx): use shared transform utility — closes DoD item 2.4 on VFS_REFACTOR

✔ [ ] 2.5 — Update `CatalogueCarousel.tsx` to import and use `transformCatalogueJson` from `catalogue-nav.utils.ts`. Remove the inline transformation code. @done(26-03-26 12:59)
