## Layer 4: GROQ Query Integration

### Scope Contract
- `getSelectedProducts.ts` must replace `categoryPath match "string/*"` with `count(catalogueLocationKeys[@ in $unrolledKeys]) > 0`.
- The function signature must accept unrolled VFS keys instead of a path string.
- `getProductsByCategoryPath.ts` is legacy and must NOT be deleted yet, but a new VFS-based equivalent must be created.

### DoD

- [ ] 4.1 — Create `sanity/lib/products/getProductsByVfsKeys.ts`. Export function `getProductsByVfsKeys(keys: string[])` that executes the GROQ query: `*[_type == "product" && count(catalogueLocationKeys[@ in $keys]) > 0] | order(name asc)` using the Sanity client. The function receives pre-unrolled keys as its only argument.
  - Difficulty: 3 - A(sanity/lib/products/getProductsByVfsKeys.ts): create VFS-aware product query function — closes DoD item 4.1 on VFS_REFACTOR

- [ ] 4.2 — In `getSelectedProducts.ts`: change the function parameter `path: string[] | string` to `catalogueKeys: string[]`. Replace the `pathQuery` construction block (lines 107-114) with: `pathQuery = catalogueKeys.length > 0 ? \` && count(catalogueLocationKeys[@ in $catalogueKeys]) > 0\` : ""`. Add `catalogueKeys` to the Sanity client fetch params.
  - Difficulty: 5 - B(sanity/lib/products/getSelectedProducts.ts): replace leaky string-path matching with VFS key intersection — closes DoD item 4.2 on VFS_REFACTOR

- [ ] 4.3 — In `app/(store)/products/[...category]/page.tsx`: update the active code block (lines 1-148) to use VFS resolution instead of passing raw path strings. The flow must be: (a) resolve slug via `resolveSlugToId`, (b) unroll via `unrollDescendantKeys`, (c) pass keys to `getSelectedProducts`. Remove the commented-out VFS prototype code (lines 150-288) after integrating its logic into the active code.
  - Difficulty: 8 - A(app/(store)/products/[...category]/page.tsx): integrate VFS resolution into live category page — closes DoD item 4.3 on VFS_REFACTOR

- [ ] 4.4 — Update `getFiltersForCategoryPathAction` and `getSortablesForCategoryPathAction` call signatures in the category page to accept VFS keys instead of path strings. If these functions internally use `categoryPath`, update their GROQ to use `catalogueLocationKeys[@ in $keys]` as well.
  - Difficulty: 5 - A(app/actions/categories + sanity/lib): migrate filter and sort actions to VFS key resolution — closes DoD item 4.4 on VFS_REFACTOR

- [ ] 4.5 — Verify the application compiles with `npm run build`. Zero type errors, zero build warnings related to VFS changes.
  - Difficulty: 1 - E(project): verify clean build after VFS integration — closes DoD item 4.5 on VFS_REFACTOR

